---
---

<section class="stack-section">
  <div class="section-label">The Full Stack</div>
  <h2>The complete agent lifecycle.</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">
    Where Parliament fits in the heybeaux ecosystem — five layers, each answering a different question.
  </p>

  <div class="stack">
    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-label">ACR</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">what agents CAN do</span>
      <span class="stack-tag">Capabilities</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector"></div>
    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-label">AWM</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">what agents WILL do</span>
      <span class="stack-tag">Planning</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector"></div>
    <div class="stack-item highlight">
      <span class="stack-label">Parliament</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">whether they SHOULD do it</span>
      <span class="stack-tag">Judgment</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector"></div>
    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-label">Engram</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">what agents DID</span>
      <span class="stack-tag">Memory</span>
    </div>
    <div class="connector"></div>
    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-label">Forge</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">how it all flows</span>
      <span class="stack-tag">Orchestration</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .stack-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .stack-item {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .stack-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .stack-item.highlight {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--accent-glow);
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08);
  }

  .stack-label {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .stack-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .stack-tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .connector {
    width: 2px;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--border);
  }
</style>
